    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meadow Island was once a picturesque fishing town. Now, it's quietly transforming into a business park for the sprawling city next door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But something\u2019s off. Why are corporations, security agencies\u2014and criminals\u2014so invested in this fading seaside town?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you dive into the island\u2019s underground scene, you\u2019ll form alliances with hackers, forgers, radio pirates, and graffiti artists.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your new gig as a security tester doesn\u2019t just pay you to break into buildings\u2014it gives you the perfect cover to uncover the town\u2019s deepest secrets.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simulated Phone System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simulated Networks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simulated Computers including boot disks and services</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meadow Island was once a picturesque fishing town. Now, it's quietly transforming into a business park for the sprawling city next door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But something\u2019s off. Why are corporations, security agencies\u2014and criminals\u2014so invested in this fading seaside town?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you dive into the island\u2019s underground scene, you\u2019ll form alliances with hackers, forgers, radio pirates, and graffiti artists.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your new gig as a security tester doesn\u2019t just pay you to break into buildings\u2014it gives you the perfect cover to uncover the town\u2019s deepest secrets.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simulated Phone System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simulated Networks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simulated Computers including boot disks and services</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Become a Hacker, Cat burglar or Conman and use your skills to investigate the conspiracy gripping your town. Hack realistic computer networks, Forge ID\u2019s, Tap phone lines and sneak your way through the \u201890s hacker scene. Includes systematic game play allowing creative solutions.",
